<title>USA: Foundation Health director Olson steps down.</title>
<headline>Foundation Health director Olson steps down.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO CORDOVA, Calif. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foundation Health Corp Wednesday said Frank Olson resigned from the company's board of directors, effective September 12.</p>
<p>In a statement, Daniel Crowley, chairman, president and chief executive officer, said the company does not intend to fill the vacated board position immediately. Currently there are four inside and six outside directors.</p>
<p>Olson is chairman and chief executive officer of Ford Motor Co's Hertz Corp.</p>
